    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s the thing... there isn’t really a \"place\" for me anymore. the house is just a museum of things he’s not here to use. it feels so absurd to keep living this life where everything is just a reminder of what's missing. like, why does anyone keep trying when everything eventually just turns to nothing? it feels like we're all just pretending that staying around matters.",
